Revision history for FFI-Platypus-Lang-V

0.04      2026-10-02 03:33:19 -0600
  - Build V shared libraries with -DNO_EXECUTE_PERMISSION to work around
    a bug in V 0.4.x (fixed in 0.5) that caused a "Cannot allocate
    executable pages" abort with -prod on macOS arm64 (gh#6)
  - Support V 0.5.x: functions must be exported with @[export], and
    sources may no longer live in a src/ directory (gh#6)

0.02      2024-12-21 04:43:04 -0700
  - Bump required Path::Tiny to 0.130 for ->mkdir

0.01      2024-12-18 18:15:08 -0700
  - initial version


